00:21:35.250 --> 00:21:41.080
<v Man>I had a stroke about four, five years ago. And I've got high blood sugar.

00:21:41.080 --> 00:21:44.160
<v David Black>God bless you. God love you.

00:21:44.160 --> 00:21:44.960
<v Man>God bless you. God love you.

00:21:44.960 --> 00:21:45.650
<v David Black>Praise the lord.

00:21:45.650 --> 00:21:46.200
<v Man>Praise the lord.

