<v David Black>--with the punishing rod.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:03.170
<v Man>--with the punishing rod.

00:22:03.170 --> 00:22:04.330
<v David Black>Forgive me of my sins--

00:22:04.330 --> 00:22:05.430
<v Man>Forgive me of my sins--

00:22:05.430 --> 00:22:06.480
<v David Black>Louder, please.

00:22:06.480 --> 00:22:08.290
<v Man>Forgive me for my sins--

00:22:08.290 --> 00:22:09.620
<v David Black>And take me to heaven--

00:22:09.620 --> 00:22:10.960
<v Man>And take me to heaven--

00:22:10.960 --> 00:22:13.330
<v David Black>--on a muskrat.

00:22:13.330 --> 00:22:24.700
<v Man>--on a muskrat.

00:22:24.700 --> 00:22:25.910
<v David Black>Love me, father.

00:22:25.910 --> 00:22:26.740
<v Man>Love me, father.

00:22:26.740 --> 00:22:28.240
<v David Black>You need to be louder, please.

00:22:28.240 --> 00:22:29.620
<v Man>Love me, father.

00:22:29.620 --> 00:22:31.000
<v David Black>Love me like you do--

00:22:31.000 --> 00:22:31.920
<v Man>Love me like you do--

00:22:31.920 --> 00:22:34.460
<v David Black>--the little roach--

00:22:34.460 --> 00:22:35.150
<v Man>--the little roach.

00:22:35.150 --> 00:22:36.620
<v David Black>Louder, louder.

00:22:36.620 --> 00:22:38.160
<v Man>The little roach! The little roach!

00:22:38.160 --> 00:22:38.730
<v David Black>Take me--

00:22:38.730 --> 00:22:39.320
<v Man>Take me--

00:22:39.320 --> 00:22:39.900
<v David Black>--by--

00:22:39.900 --> 00:22:40.390
<v Man>--by--

00:22:40.390 --> 00:22:41.360
<v David Black>Louder. Take me--

00:22:41.360 --> 00:22:41.840
<v Man>Take me--

00:22:41.840 --> 00:22:42.330
<v David Black>--by--

00:22:42.330 --> 00:22:42.870
<v Man>--by--

00:22:42.870 --> 00:22:43.160
<v David Black>--the--

00:22:43.160 --> 00:22:43.450
<v Man>--the--

00:22:43.450 --> 00:22:44.380
